text = "rescued from her /cyber space~  \nprison thanks to sonic,amy    \ncanon is back with much more  \nexp,far stronger than before: \nshe's now stronger than her   \nversion of this dimension.    \nher /tarot~ power and her       \nbetter use of the /hammer      \nparry~ let her fight on equal  \nground against the assassins. \n                              \n`p.s.: sobre los exes:~\n\exetior~: podria ser una pelea\nde igual a igual por su poder,\ndigo /posible~, entre muchas\ncomillas. \exeller~: `este compa\nya esta muerto~. el que mas me\ncae mal de los 4. \chaos~: quien\nte conose. el exe: tambien es\nun \idiota~. \-10~ sobre \10~";